:''Not to be confused with [[Kuwagata Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Kuwagata Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] implemented in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.0 Update|Patch 1.0.0]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] It was created as promotional material for the Nintendo Switch port and incentivized players to purchase the February 2019 CoroCoro Comic Issue in which it would contain a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] to obtain said unit. As of the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|August 15, 2023 Update Patch]], Kuwagata Cat is now a login bonus once clearing [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] from the [[Empire of Cats]]. As of now, Kuwagata Cat remains exclusive to the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') version.

